    "created_at": "2024-04-03T03:41:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-04-03T03:41:48Z",
    "body": "WebBluetooth likely won't support anything enabling this kind of communication for many years. WebNFC should, in theory, be able to exchange WebRTC Session Descriptions to enable this functionality. I doubt anyone has built this solution, yet.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
