    "created_at": "2024-04-05T18:02:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-04-05T18:02:05Z",
    "body": "Allowing sites to communicate through BLE devices has interesting use cases. However, the current spec only defines APIs for central role operation. Defining peripheral behavior and scoping platform API support for peripheral mode requires substantial work and is not currently planned.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
